<title>USA: Sigma Designs sees &quot;small&quot; Q4 profit.</title>
<headline>Sigma Designs sees &quot;small&quot; Q4 profit.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sigma Designs Inc said it expects to report a &quot;small&quot; profit on sales of about $9.5 million in the in the fourth quarter ended January 31.</p>
<p>It said the sales would be lower than previously expected and were due to a delay in the receipt of graphics chips from a semiconductor foundry in the Far East, compounded with  lower than expected demand for its Explorer chipset.</p>
</text>
